{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28510"},"reason":"New question on Lyonesse, the most famous sunken land of British legend after Avalon, which the article lacked; verified on Wikipedia's Lyonesse article (land from Land's End to Scilly swallowed in one night, 140 churches, 11 November 1099 in tradition, home of Tristan, Trevelyan on a white horse, Swinburne's 1882 epic).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyonesse"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Lyonesse"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Lyonesse"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Лионесс"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[1883,8],"de":[2075,8],"ru":[1962,7]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"1882","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Swinburne publishes the epic „Tristram of Lyonesse“","labelDe":"Swinburne veröffentlicht das Epos „Tristram of Lyonesse“","labelRu":"Суинберн публикует поэму «Тристрам Лионесский»"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyonesse","title":"Lyonesse – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"668092e05a9e"},
{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27510"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on Lyonesse, the most famous sunken land of British legend after Avalon, which the article lacked; verified on Wikipedia's Lyonesse article (land from Land's End to Scilly swallowed in one night, 140 churches, 11 November 1099 in tradition, home of Tristan, Trevelyan on a white horse, Swinburne's 1882 epic).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which legendary kingdom, the homeland of Tristan, is said to have sunk beneath the sea between Land's End and the Isles of Scilly?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welches sagenhafte Königreich, die Heimat Tristans, soll zwischen Land's End und den Scilly-Inseln im Meer versunken sein?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Какое легендарное королевство, родина Тристана, по преданию ушло под воду между мысом Лендс-Энд и островами Силли?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28510"}],"hash":"a9317c79df44"},
